he true story of The Cat, The Myth, The Legend... The Boots.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":38055,\"title\":\"Megamind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uZ9ytt3sPTx62XTfN56ILSuYWRe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/irpJXGiVr539uuspcQcNdkhS2lq.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After Megamind, a highly intelligent alien supervillain, defeats his long-time nemesis Metro Man, Megamind creates a new hero to fight, but must act to save the city when his \\\"creation\\\" becomes an even worse villain than he was.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":893723,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Mighty Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aTvePCU7exLepwg5hWySjwxojQK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zgQQF04u3OgNBJqClRNby1FPz9s.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A magical meteor crash lands in Adventure City and gives the PAW Patrol pups superpowers, transforming them into The Mighty Pups.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10555,\"title\":\"Shark Tale\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r08DpyPyhXcJTfNZAICNGMzcQ8l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ZmZxar3bYORcl0TPA4oceyxcaE.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Oscar is a small fish whose big aspirations often get him into trouble. Meanwhile, Lenny is a great white shark with a surprising secret that no sea creature would guess: He's a vegetarian. When a lie turns Oscar into an improbable hero and Lenny becomes an outcast, the two form an unlikely friendship.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"3n58UPvcD7I\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"GVy7m3VPBjk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"sit